## Purpose

Give the six Instagram images different background colours without recolouring
the cream sculptures, replacing the lightly frosted pane or changing the website.

## Tasks

- [x] Add an explicit portrait-only colour option; keep default rendering unchanged.
- [x] Preserve real final website captures, foreground positions and typography.
- [x] Apply buttercream, blush, soft green, peach, oat and vanilla ground colours.
