## Acceptance criteria

- Six distinct Instagram grounds, with sharp unchanged foreground and ivory cream.
- No opaque text patches, copied reference pixels or new website palette.
- README landscapes remain byte-identical to the preceding final kit.
- Actual JPEG typography retains its existing contrast/size gates.
- No Instagram posting, public build, commit or push for this request.

